{
  "name": "plan-cheap",
  "description": "Generic long-form building-plan pass, one system/slice per run - not tied to any one project. Renamed from smo-v2-cheap once it stopped being SMO-specific. Builder/reviser/criteria on Sonnet 5 (worth paying for the seat that writes the plan); 5 critic seats, cheap-tier, no xAI/Grok. Mistral parked (2026-09-07: account-side 429 across three keys/workspaces, unresolved on their end) - add back once it clears, nothing else needs to change. Criteria are generated fresh from whatever request/constraints the task file gives it.",
